        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F8FB;strokeColor=#C2CAD8;fontColor=#3a414d;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;How it fits together:&lt;/b&gt;  BLUE = detector (after_tool_callback): builds the AgBOM ledger, decays trust_score on Intent Drift, raises quarantine_flag.  GREEN = responder (before_tool_callback): reads the flag and halts the NEXT tool call via RuntimeError.  The enforcement loop closes through shared session state, not a direct call — Blue flags now, Green enforces on the following tool invocation." vertex="1">
